@startuml Guest_Profile_Management_SSD

actor "Guest" as Guest
participant "UI: Guest Profile" as UI

== View Profile ==

Guest -> UI: Access guest profile page
activate UI

UI --> Guest: Display guest profile\n(default avatar, "Guest User",\n"Exploring Mode")
deactivate UI

== View Disabled Options ==

Guest -> UI: View profile options
activate UI

UI --> Guest: Display profile menu:\n• Account (disabled)\n• Birthday (disabled)\n• Gender (disabled)\n• Country (disabled)\n• Language (enabled)\n• Settings (enabled)

deactivate UI

note right of Guest
  **Guest Restrictions:**
  • Cannot upload profile picture
  • Cannot edit account info
  • Cannot set birthday
  • Cannot set gender
  • Cannot set country
  • Can only change language
  • Can access basic settings
end note

== Change Language ==

Guest -> UI: Navigate to Language settings
activate UI

UI --> Guest: Display language options\n(English/Filipino)

Guest -> UI: Select language

UI -> UI: Update app language\n(save to localStorage as "guestLanguage")

UI --> Guest: Refresh interface with new language
deactivate UI

== Access Settings ==

Guest -> UI: Navigate to Settings
activate UI

UI --> Guest: Display guest settings\n(tutorial replay, privacy policy, etc.)

deactivate UI

== Logout ==

Guest -> UI: Click "Logout"
activate UI

UI -> UI: Clear guest data:\n- localStorage (token, guest, guestLanguage)\n- sessionStorage\n- All guest_* keys

UI --> Guest: Redirect to login page
deactivate UI

@enduml
